{"id":"73db783e2d738e08","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-omega2.md","title":"Second Uncountable Ordinal","display":"df-omega2 — Second Uncountable Ordinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-omega2","aliases":["58-df-omega2"],"display":"df-omega2 — Second Uncountable Ordinal","depends_on":["[[58-df-aleph]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-omega2"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-omega2</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega2 — Second Uncountable Ordinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"535817bf563314f5\" href=\"?note=535817bf563314f5\" title=\"58-df-aleph\">58-df-aleph</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_2\\in V\">\\(\\aleph_2\\in V\\)</span>（aleph 类递归在序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span> 处的值；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"535817bf563314f5\" href=\"?note=535817bf563314f5\" title=\"58-df-aleph\">58-df-aleph</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_2\\in V\">\\(\\omega_2\\in V\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega2} \\vdash \\omega_2 \\coloneqq \\aleph_2\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega2} \\vdash \\omega_2 \\coloneqq \\aleph_2\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_2\">\\(\\aleph_2\\)</span> 本身就是第二个不可数初始序数，直接令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_2=\\aleph_2\">\\(\\omega_2=\\aleph_2\\)</span>，不再以未经定义的基数运算和极小化重复刻画。</li>\n<li>Under GCH, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_2 = \\aleph_2 = 2^{\\aleph_1}\">\\(\\omega_2 = \\aleph_2 = 2^{\\aleph_1}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-aleph","status":"resolved","id":"535817bf563314f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-aleph]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-aleph","status":"resolved","id":"535817bf563314f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\aleph_2\\in V$（aleph 类递归在序数 $2$ 处的值；see [[58-df-aleph]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\aleph_2\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"2","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_2\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega2} \\vdash \\omega_2 \\coloneqq \\aleph_2","display":true},{"tex":"\\aleph_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_2=\\aleph_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_2 = \\aleph_2 = 2^{\\aleph_1}","display":false}],"bytes":704,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0902736e45e6217","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-901","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-omega2.md|58-df-omega2]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["535817bf563314f5"]}